Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.96,0:00:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,就快到了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.39,0:00:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 吉隆
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.68,0:00:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,嚄嚄 嚄嚄
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,艾克大人是用飄浮魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才能輕鬆上去 嚄嚄
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.76,0:00:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,嚄嚄 嚄嚄
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.73,0:00:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣 吉隆
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.14,0:00:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,應該瘦了一點吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.65,0:00:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,體重是其次 我嚇到短命了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.85,0:00:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,目的地還沒到嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.97,0:00:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,已經看得到了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.65,0:00:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那裡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.45,0:00:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,就是這個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.74,0:00:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,天然硝石
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:28.92,OPJP,,0,0,0,,二度目はない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.92,0:01:31.29,OPJP,,0,0,0,,I'm decaying one minute at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.29,0:01:32.85,OPJP,,0,0,0,,訳などない が
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.85,0:01:35.06,OPJP,,0,0,0,,Everything is gonna be all fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.21,0:01:37.49,OPJP,,0,0,0,,ねえ、なんて言った？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.68,0:01:38.72,OPJP,,0,0,0,,When did I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.72,0:01:40.79,OPJP,,0,0,0,,Stop caring about it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.17,0:01:43.00,OPJP,,0,0,0,,私いないみたい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.00,0:01:45.37,OPJP,,0,0,0,,Do I exist in this version of life ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.37,0:01:46.45,OPJP,,0,0,0,,飽きの来ない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.45,0:01:49.23,OPJP,,0,0,0,,設計の甘い daily life
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.37,0:01:51.79,OPJP,,0,0,0,,ねえ、なって言った？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.79,0:01:52.90,OPJP,,0,0,0,,A, where is my mind ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.90,0:01:55.13,OPJP,,0,0,0,,B, stop caring about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.42,0:01:57.57,OPJP,,0,0,0,,Something's howling inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.57,0:01:59.35,OPJP,,0,0,0,,Howling inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.49,0:02:01.04,OPJP,,0,0,0,,Howling inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.10,0:02:02.93,OPJP,,0,0,0,,Howling inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.03,0:02:04.61,OPJP,,0,0,0,,Howling inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.61,0:02:06.10,OPJP,,0,0,0,,吐きそうなくらい
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.10,0:02:07.60,OPJP,,0,0,0,,I know it, I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.60,0:02:08.62,OPJP,,0,0,0,,生きる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.39,0:02:12.98,OPJP,,0,0,0,,"I wanna be the first one to make it there"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.98,0:02:16.29,OPJP,,0,0,0,,繰り返しの先で言える？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.52,0:02:19.82,OPJP,,0,0,0,,How do I get out of this loop?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.02,0:02:23.42,OPJP,,0,0,0,,傍観という名のtool
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.61,0:02:27.07,OPJP,,0,0,0,,わかってる 黙っていたいなんて
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.07,0:02:30.43,OPJP,,0,0,0,,新しくもない夜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.63,0:02:33.96,OPJP,,0,0,0,,Am I still in love with this blue ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.11,0:02:39.54,OPJP,,0,0,0,,Am I still in love with, still in love with this blue ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:28.92,OPCN,,0,0,0,,沒有第二次機會
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.92,0:01:31.29,OPCN,,0,0,0,,我正每分每秒地逐漸衰敗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.29,0:01:32.85,OPCN,,0,0,0,,雖然毫無理由
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.85,0:01:35.06,OPCN,,0,0,0,,但一切都會好轉的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.21,0:01:37.49,OPCN,,0,0,0,,吶  你剛說了什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.68,0:01:38.72,OPCN,,0,0,0,,我是從何時
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.72,0:01:40.79,OPCN,,0,0,0,,開始不再在乎這一切的？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.17,0:01:43.00,OPCN,,0,0,0,,感覺我不存在似的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.00,0:01:45.37,OPCN,,0,0,0,,我真的存在於這個版本的人生裡嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.37,0:01:46.45,OPCN,,0,0,0,,不會讓人厭倦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.45,0:01:49.23,OPCN,,0,0,0,,設計得太過天真的日常生活
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.37,0:01:51.79,OPCN,,0,0,0,,吶  你剛說了什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.79,0:01:52.90,OPCN,,0,0,0,,A. 我的心在哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.90,0:01:55.13,OPCN,,0,0,0,,B. 別再管它了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.42,0:01:57.57,OPCN,,0,0,0,,有什麼東西在內心深處咆哮著
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.57,0:01:59.35,OPCN,,0,0,0,,在內心深處咆哮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.49,0:02:01.04,OPCN,,0,0,0,,在內心深處咆哮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.10,0:02:02.93,OPCN,,0,0,0,,在內心深處咆哮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.03,0:02:04.61,OPCN,,0,0,0,,在內心深處咆哮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.61,0:02:06.10,OPCN,,0,0,0,,幾乎令人作嘔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.10,0:02:07.60,OPCN,,0,0,0,,我深知  我也看見了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.60,0:02:08.62,OPCN,,0,0,0,,活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.39,0:02:12.98,OPCN,,0,0,0,,"我想成為第一個到達那裡的人"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.98,0:02:16.29,OPCN,,0,0,0,,歷經無數重複後還能這樣說嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.52,0:02:19.82,OPCN,,0,0,0,,我該如何逃離這個迴圈?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.02,0:02:23.42,OPCN,,0,0,0,,依賴著名為旁觀的工具
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.61,0:02:27.07,OPCN,,0,0,0,,我知道保持沉默這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.07,0:02:30.43,OPCN,,0,0,0,,早就不是什麼陌生的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.63,0:02:33.96,OPCN,,0,0,0,,我還愛著這片憂鬱的藍嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.11,0:02:39.54,OPCN,,0,0,0,,我還愛著、還愛著這片憂鬱的藍嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.60,0:02:48.06,Title3,,0,0,0,,魔王軍　魔術師 {\1c&H120097&}人類
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.60,0:02:48.06,Title3,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\an1\pos(745,1075)}最\N強的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.60,0:02:48.06,Title3,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\an1\pos(1220,1070)}是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.53,0:02:55.03,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,0)\pos(960,800)}開戰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.63,0:02:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,舉槍
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.52,0:03:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,射擊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.44,0:03:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,嚄嚄
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.09,0:03:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.47,0:03:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,裝填子彈
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.29,0:03:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,舉槍
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.39,0:03:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,射擊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.25,0:03:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,居然在這麼短的時間內\N就修好了城門
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.67,0:03:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是用了什麼樣的魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.99,0:03:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我採用輪班制
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.30,0:03:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,還有付人類酬勞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.41,0:03:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,付人類酬勞啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.45,0:03:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,團長也提過這件事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.86,0:03:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,這個方法比強迫他們工作\N效率更高 真神奇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.40,0:04:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好窄啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.09,0:04:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我直接用原來的辦公室
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.29,0:04:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好久不見了 艾克
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.05,0:04:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不對 副團長
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.51,0:04:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,叫我艾克就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.89,0:04:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,上下關係必須要分清楚才行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.15,0:04:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,這下子都到齊了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.58,0:04:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我想各位應該已經聽說了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.72,0:04:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,這次的戰爭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.17,0:04:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,瑟菲洛大人交給副團長全權負責
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.61,0:04:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,從現在起 各位要服從艾克大人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.57,0:04:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒有意見
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.19,0:04:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,聽說你痛扁了帕斯狄歐那混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.38,0:04:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,挺厲害的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.19,0:04:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我們三人會服從副團長
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.45,0:04:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝你們
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.86,0:04:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼 聽說敵軍有12000人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.57,0:04:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,而我們只有2000人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.57,0:04:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,要怎麼打呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.42,0:05:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,1人對付6人就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.61,0:05:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,正面擊潰他們
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.54,0:05:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我們的士兵
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.47,0:05:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,並非每個都是號稱菁英的人狼旅團
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.63,0:05:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,說得也是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.64,0:05:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,夜襲怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.56,0:05:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,夜晚的黑暗是我們的領域吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.93,0:05:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我們已經確認敵軍有魔術師
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.95,0:05:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,應該會用照明魔法\N或探知魔法應付吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.74,0:05:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好麻煩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.78,0:05:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,副團長有什麼想法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.66,0:05:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,在這裡迎戰他們
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.46,0:05:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,固守城池嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.88,0:05:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,所謂大軍 佔有的優勢越高
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.53,0:05:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,轉成劣勢的時候就越脆弱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.56,0:05:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,越不堪一擊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.88,0:05:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,讓他們攻打這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.71,0:05:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,等他們的士氣達到最高點時
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.88,0:05:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,再一網打盡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.14,0:05:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,速戰速決
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.74,0:05:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,以最短的時間和最小的傷害\N結束這場仗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.09,0:06:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,這個呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.26,0:06:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,請丟不可燃垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.54,0:06:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,城裡變得好熱鬧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.00,0:06:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,妳不害怕嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.02,0:06:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然還是有些人會怕
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.21,0:06:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不怕
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.14,0:06:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.64,0:06:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,因為大家是為了保護這裡才來的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.50,0:06:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都是好人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.87,0:06:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 沒有壞人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.33,0:07:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 這讓我很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.03,0:07:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然無法幫忙打仗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.10,0:07:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,但我能幫忙準備飯菜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.96,0:07:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,因為士兵變多 辛苦妳了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.09,0:07:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不會
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.42,0:07:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不過…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.84,0:07:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.84,0:07:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在想有沒有\N能做給許多人吃的料理
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.86,0:07:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,結果想來想去幾乎都是湯類
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.09,0:07:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我想想…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.67,0:07:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,這怎麼行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.55,0:07:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,主人請專心工作吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.57,0:07:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,吃飯關係到士兵的士氣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.00,0:07:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,這也是工作的一環
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.01,0:07:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好 我們不缺糧食
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.05,0:07:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,都是多虧主人的諾福克輪作制
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.87,0:07:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,有米吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.18,0:07:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,有 收成很多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.30,0:07:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,試著做這個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.14,0:07:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,炒…飯?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.98,0:08:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,這就是炒飯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.39,0:08:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不用花很多時間
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.30,0:08:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,應該能大量製作吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.26,0:09:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.20,0:09:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,這個香味 讓人食指大動
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.16,0:09:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,看來能提高士兵們的士氣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.61,0:09:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,吃吃看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.66,0:09:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.90,0:09:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你們兩位自己吃太奸詐了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.92,0:09:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你要吃嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.60,0:09:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我要
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.62,0:09:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,看起來好好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.02,0:09:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,聽說這叫炒飯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.91,0:09:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,名字聽起來就很好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.57,0:09:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.30,0:09:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好奸詐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.43,0:09:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,這個料理太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.32,0:09:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好好吃 太好吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.66,0:09:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,再來一碗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.91,0:09:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,來 請用
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.73,0:09:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好像有點太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.69,0:09:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,請多吃一點 攝取大量的營養吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.48,0:10:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,這是叫我變胖的意思嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.99,0:10:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 拜託妳們開心吃啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.36,0:10:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,艾克大人您…不吃嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.92,0:10:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我晚點再吃
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.78,0:10:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,味道怎麼樣 吉隆
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.63,0:10:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,非常好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.40,0:10:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,可以當我軍的伙食嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.16,0:10:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,當然行啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.85,0:10:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,肉和油的味道完全滲進米飯裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.20,0:10:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是這個
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.91,0:10:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,偏好肉食的其他旅團也會很滿意吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.25,0:10:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.99,0:10:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,兵力到齊了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.67,0:10:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,城牆也修好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.52,0:11:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,裝備也準備好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.57,0:11:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,接下來 只要去做就好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.68,0:11:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,來…來了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.53,0:11:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是諸王同盟軍
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.87,0:11:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,快點
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.51,0:11:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.41,0:11:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,艾克大人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.23,0:11:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,祝您旗開得勝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.68,0:12:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.13,0:12:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,如果這裡陷落了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.89,0:12:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,諸王同盟軍的戰力\N就會集中到阿森諾
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.38,0:12:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我們必須阻止這件事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.59,0:12:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,無論如何都要守住這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.80,0:12:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.91,0:12:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.09,0:12:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,規模比想像中還要小呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.61,0:12:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,真令人失望
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.08,0:13:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.03,0:13:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,虧我們還找來了各國最優秀的士兵
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.22,0:13:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣根本算不上戰爭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.88,0:13:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,這不是戰爭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.80,0:13:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是討伐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.44,0:13:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,討伐骯髒的魔物們
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.14,0:13:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,擊潰他們
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.88,0:13:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.31,0:13:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,開始攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.51,0:14:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,發光屏障
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.33,0:14:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,居然是魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.11,0:14:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,再來一次
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.88,0:14:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.86,0:15:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他們用普通的方式進攻啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.08,0:15:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,多虧如此 我才能應對
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.82,0:15:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不愧是艾克大人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.67,0:15:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,這下魔王軍不就最強了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.61,0:15:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,奉承我也沒有好處
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.30,0:15:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,接下來 會怎麼出招
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.35,0:15:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,真愛耍小聰明
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.75,0:15:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,再來一次
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.32,0:15:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.37,0:15:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,又來了 明明沒有用
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.03,0:15:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,愚蠢的傢伙們
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.26,0:15:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,發光屏障
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.86,0:15:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.97,0:16:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,趁現在
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.97,0:16:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是 第1隊 進攻
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.35,0:16:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,看來沒這麼容易啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.95,0:16:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,艾克大人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.13,0:16:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,鐵砲隊 準備好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.82,0:16:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,時候還沒到
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.20,0:16:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.44,0:16:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,交給他們吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.90,0:17:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,反擊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.40,0:18:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,發光屏障
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.39,0:18:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,人數方面是我們佔優勢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.19,0:18:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,上啊 上啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.07,0:18:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,別讓他們爬上來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.83,0:18:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,守住
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.35,0:18:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,區區的魔族 還挺能幹的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.04,0:19:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不過 這只是時間的問題
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.70,0:19:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,只要像這樣持續進攻…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.49,0:19:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,晚餐吃什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.08,0:19:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.09,0:19:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,吃飯應該要安靜地吃
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.44,0:19:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,在那之前結束吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.24,0:19:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.75,0:19:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,可是…要怎麼做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.37,0:19:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,再發射一次彈射器
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.06,0:19:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那樣我軍也會出現傷亡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.75,0:19:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,無所謂
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.71,0:19:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,發光屏障
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.73,0:19:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,趴下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.85,0:19:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,嚄嚄
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.89,0:20:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,嚄嚄
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.68,0:20:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那些傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.35,0:20:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然連同伴也一起殺
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.61,0:21:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,第2隊 進攻
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.20,0:21:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.35,0:21:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,別讓他們進入城裡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.65,0:22:21.86,EDEN,,0,0,0,,You just took my hands and held me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.24,0:22:27.21,EDEN,,0,0,0,,But I look away my pains and gap.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.75,0:22:36.63,EDEN,,0,0,0,,That makes me face to everything with my real eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.15,0:22:47.44,EDEN,,0,0,0,,It goes on without my own will.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.71,0:22:52.73,EDEN,,0,0,0,,They won't care about my tears fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.90,0:22:58.36,EDEN,,0,0,0,,These wounds still shows that no signs of healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.51,0:23:01.94,EDEN,,0,0,0,,Road seems so long and so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.94,0:23:04.35,EDEN,,0,0,0,,We can't see the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.35,0:23:09.53,EDEN,,0,0,0,,Forgive and learn from all the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.03,0:23:15.08,EDEN,,0,0,0,,mistakes we made show us future.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.27,0:23:20.44,EDEN,,0,0,0,,I wanna know your shape that you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.70,0:23:24.07,EDEN,,0,0,0,,I just want to know what makes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.14,0:23:27.19,EDEN,,0,0,0,,To take your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.65,0:22:21.86,EDCN,,0,0,0,,你只是牽起我的手  將我扶起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.24,0:22:27.21,EDCN,,0,0,0,,但我移開了視線  逃避我的痛苦與落差
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.75,0:22:36.63,EDCN,,0,0,0,,那使我得用真實的雙眼去面對一切
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.15,0:22:47.44,EDCN,,0,0,0,,儘管不顧我的意志  世界仍繼續運轉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.71,0:22:52.73,EDCN,,0,0,0,,他們不會在乎我落下的眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.90,0:22:58.36,EDCN,,0,0,0,,這些傷口依然看不出任何癒合的跡象
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.51,0:23:01.94,EDCN,,0,0,0,,前方的路看似如此漫長且遙遠
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.94,0:23:04.35,EDCN,,0,0,0,,我們看不見盡頭
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.35,0:23:09.53,EDCN,,0,0,0,,原諒並從我們所犯的錯誤中學習
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.03,0:23:15.08,EDCN,,0,0,0,,它將為我們指引未來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.27,0:23:20.44,EDCN,,0,0,0,,我想知道你原本真實的模樣
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.70,0:23:24.07,EDCN,,0,0,0,,我只想知道是什麼造就了你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.14,0:23:27.19,EDCN,,0,0,0,,讓我去牽起你的手
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.35,0:23:39.67,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\pos(960,820)}決戰伊凡利亞斯
